  "description": "TakeMov G35M Electric Mountain Bike for Adults combines strong performance, comfort-focused design, making it ideal for outdoor riding and trail adventures.\nEquipped with a 1000W rated brushless motor (peak 2000W), it delivers strong torque for smooth acceleration and climbing ability, with a top speed of 28-40MPH under ideal conditions (The default speed is 20 mph. If you need more, please contact us).\nThe 48V 25Ah battery provides reliable range for different riding needs, delivering approximately 35 miles in electric mode and up to 80 miles with pedal assist depending on terrain, rider weight, and assist level. The integrated BMS (Battery Management System) enhances safety by protecting against overcharge, overcurrent, and short circuits.\nThis electric bike features NFC keyless unlock, allowing riders to access instantly without keys. Combined with a 7-speed gear system and 3 riding modes, it offers flexible control and a customizable riding experience.\nThe full suspension system absorbs shocks from uneven terrain, while the 20\" x 4.0\" fat tires provide strong grip and stability across sand, gravel, and off-road surfaces.\nThe upgraded color LCD display shows real-time riding data including speed, battery level, and mileage.\nThis electric bicycle arrives 95% pre-assembled for easy setup and meets UL2849 safety standards.\nPlease contact us directly through Walmart messaging. We will guide you step by step.",
